    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties is delighted to present No. 17 The Lawn, Priory Court, to the market. This is a well-proportioned three-bedroom semi-detached family home in one of Watergrasshill's most popular residential developments. Extending to approximately 102.98 sq. m., the property offers bright, practical living space, three good bedrooms (main en-suite), a private rear garden and off-street parking for two, all within easy reach of the village and the M8.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2004 and well maintained throughout, the home is ready to move into and would suit families, first-time buyers and commuters alike, with Cork City around 25 minutes away.\r\n\r\nWatergrasshill village is within walking distance and offers an excellent range of amenities including primary and secondary schools, convenience retail, pharmacy, playground and an active GAA club.\r\n\r\nAccommodation: Entrance Hallway, Guest Toilet, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Area, 3 Bedrooms (1 en-suite) and Family Bathroom. \r\n(Circa 102.98 (m2) )\r\nGuide Price: €325,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nEntrance Hall:\t Welcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\tFront-aspect reception room with wood flooring and an open fireplace.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C:\tWC, wash-hand basin and tiled flooring, with plumbing for a washing machine.\r\nKitchen/\r\nDining Area: \tBright and generously proportioned, with a fully fitted kitchen (integrated oven, freestanding fridge freezer and dishwasher) and tiled flooring. The dining area opens to the rear garden through sliding doors.\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nMain Bedroom:\tFront-aspect double bedroom with timber flooring & fitted wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite:\tFully tiled, comprising W.C., w.h.b and shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\tRear-aspect double bedroom with timber flooring & fitted wardrobes.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 3:\tRear aspect room with laminate flooring currently being used as an office.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\tTiled flooring with W.C., w.h.b, bath & electric shower.\r\n\r\nOutside:  \tTo the front, a private driveway provides off-street parking for two cars. A small green area lies beside the parking area. The rear garden offers an open space with a garden shed and patio area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBER C3 BER Number: 117169268\r\n•\tGas central heating \r\n•\tuPVC double-glazed windows \r\n•\tOpen fireplace in the sitting room \r\n•\tPrivate, enclosed low-maintenance rear garden"
      },
